{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t恒指下午初段轉跌逾百點，恒指較早時報23107點，跌103點，跌幅0.45%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n科技指數報3827點，跌近0.8%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n滙控中午公布季績，股價較早時報135.4元，跌幅4.8%。集團上季列帳稅前盈利升32%。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T05:43:04.226648+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T05:23:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T09:18:51.650812+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T05:38:51.236025+00:00","content_hash":"15a44132e355d8975a5ae9dfb2bd98f0cd55f8afee02209899b5e37105ee69d4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}